          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(Eq. 7.8) for the potential energy of an object at height h is valid only near the Earth’s surface. Further away from the Earth’s surface, the gravitational acceleration g decreases. You will learn about the gravitational potential energy of objects far from"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
